                "title": "Omnia Metro Dummy Stainless Steel Handleset",
                "description": "The Omnia Metro Dummy Stainless Steel Handleset has a industrial chic style. It is a dummy handleset, which means it doesn't lock or latch. Just for looks, the Metro Dummy Handleset is often used in conjunction with the Single Cylinder Metro Handleset on the inactive side of a pair of French doors. \r\n",
